# -*- encoding: utf-8 -*-
# Arc: AlfredArc | Scene: MariusMarriage

translate fr strings:

    old "A man that had perhaps feared the day would never come."
    new "Un homme qui avait peut-être craint que ce jour n'arrive jamais."

    old "A minute, then two, then-"
    new "Une minute, puis deux, puis-"

    old "A man that had feared life had passed him by, and now equally feared that he had caught life but had no idea what to do with it."
    new "Un homme qui avait craint que la vie ne lui échappe, et qui craignait maintenant tout autant d'avoir saisi cette vie sans savoir quoi en faire."

    old "A few hours later, the cry of new life could be heard."
    new "Quelques heures plus tard, on entendit le cri d'une nouvelle vie."

    old "A life she could remember having, but one that seemed to have happened to someone else."
    new "Une vie qu'elle pouvait se souvenir d'avoir eue, mais qui semblait s'être déroulée pour quelqu'un d'autre."
